.TH GENETREE 1 2000-1月 "load_topology" "load_topology"
.SH NAME
load_topology \- Build the regulation graph model from the ARACNE inferred network.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIload_topology(\fBaracne\fR as <generic> AracneNetwork, 
\fBconfig\fR as <generic> GeneTreeConfig = \fB<NULL>\fR, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Build the regulation graph model from the ARACNE inferred network.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBaracne\fB \fR\- 
 the ARACNE network object, which could be created by the \fBaracne\fR package
 module or loaded from the model zip archive via \fBreadBin\fR.
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBconfig\fB \fR\- 
 the configuration object created by the \fBmake_profile\fR api; the
 \fBmax_regulators\fR and \fBinclude_undirected_edges\fR options determine the
 structure of the graph.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
the [GeneRegulationGraph](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.GeneTree.GeneRegulationGraph) object: target gene -> regulators.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
geneTree
